00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:21.540
The only ones who haven't turned them in
are you and Tanaka!

00:22:22.790 --> 00:22:25.880
You can look away all you want,
but that won't make it go away!

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:35.130
Yo! Last night was the night before the test!

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:37.710
So, together, come on, say what?

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:40.250
I went to my usual noodle shop.

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:42.960
And what I ate there was tsukemen, yeah!

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:45.750
The store owner's like, "How's today's noodles?"

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:49.040
Took only a sec to fire back with:

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:50.460
"Barikata."

00:22:50.460 --> 00:22:53.380
That's "firm" to you, y'all. Oh!

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:58.580
What's gotten into you this time, Yamamoto?

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:01.080
Men men me-me-men! Men me-men!

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:03.170
Note: MEN means "Noodles"

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:03.170
Yamamoto. I am asking about your notebook.
Men men me-me-men! Men me-men!

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:04.830
Yamamoto. I am asking about your notebook.
Men men me-me-men! Men me-men!

00:23:04.830 --> 00:23:05.330
Men men me-me-men! Men me-men!

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:07.670
Men men me-men! Me-me-me-me-me-men!

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:08.790
Men men me-men...

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:09.290
Yamamoto!
Men men me-men...

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:09.920
Yamamoto!

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:13.920
I forgot my backpack at the ramen shop.

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:16.710
I've caused a lot of trouble for my parents. Seriously.

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:20.920
So then, it was in your bag,
which you left behind at the ramen yesterday?

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:23.630
Why didn't you just say so?

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:27.710
Also, if you sang that chorus again,
I would have used a pressure point to immobilize you.

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:30.330
Wait! Please, just let me just say this!

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:37.460
Sorry, for real!
